//
// The base layer every pattern module builds on. Deliberately trivial: the value
// is that \`candle.up()\` means the same thing in every indicator, so a port never
// re-decides whether a doji counts (it does not — both tests are STRICT).
//
// 0-ANCHORED, like every stdlib primitive: these read the CURRENT bar. Pine's
// \`isUp(1)\` is \`candle.up()[1]\` at the call site (design §5).

